        "Description": "Agent 47, we got word that there is a dirty PB&amp;J in Paris, and we are not talking about the sandwich. You have been tasked to eliminate three dirty guards named Philippe Quiron, Benjamin Lacroix, and Jeremy Huxley. Intel suggests that the men have situated themselves to control the server room, the entry, and access to the third floor.\r\rYou have freedom to eliminate the targets however you see fit. Be sure to clean up Paris one afternoon snack at a time!",
